	],
	"notice": "This profile describes the original QuNexus documented in the 1.0.1 manual, not QuNexus RED or Galaxy. Connect via USB to a host and choose a compatible editor and firmware. Configure sensitivity and controller layers for the player. DIN MIDI uses the KMI MIDI Expander. Notes, tilt and pressure assignments depend on presets, so the physical keys remain unbound here. Select the profile manually if the host does not identify it: no unverified port aliases are supplied. Diagrams are original simplified schematics, not scale drawings. Physical controls without a binding are informational; use MIDI learn for configurable assignments.",
